  "title": "Phase Portraits of a 2×2 Linear System",
  "eyebrow": "linear ODE systems",
  "language": "en",
  "duration": 49,
  "topic": "For x' = A x with a 2×2 matrix A, the geometry of trajectories in the phase plane is set by the eigenvalues. Two negative real eigenvalues give a stable node; one positive and one negative gives a saddle; a complex pair with negative real part gives an inward spiral. Three small panels, three eigenvalue signatures, three pictures.",
  "concepts": [
    "phase portrait",
    "linear system of ODEs",
    "eigenvalue",
    "stable node",
    "saddle",
    "spiral",
    "vector field"
  ],
